    },
    "7 days" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "7 天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A client Poki doesn’t know (%@) is signing in with %@. Open Poki to allow or deny it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个 Poki 不认识的客户端（%1$@）正在通过 %2$@ 登录。打开 Poki 以允许或拒绝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A free Apple Account works: Poki signs itself for 7 days at a time and gets ready to sign again before then. Your Apple ID and password go only to Apple. The anisette server Poki asks for its device headers never sees them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免费 Apple 账户即可：Poki 每次为自己签名 7 天，并在到期前提前准备好下一次签名。你的 Apple ID 和密码只发送给 Apple。Poki 用来获取设备信息的 anisette 服务器看不到它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A key is saved. Enter a new one to replace it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已保存密钥。输入新密钥将覆盖原密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A live conversation uses OpenAI’s Realtime voice, which needs an OpenAI API key in Poki › Accounts and Models. Dictation in the message field works with every model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实时对话使用 OpenAI 的 Realtime 语音，需要在“Poki”›“账号与模型”中添加 OpenAI API 密钥。消息栏里的听写适用于所有模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A refreshed Poki is ready. Open Setup and tap Install before %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新的签名已准备好。请在 %@ 前打开设置引导并轻点“安装”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
