    "On it. Opening Messages." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "好的，正在打开“信息”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the Voice page, holding the button starts a live conversation: Poki listens, acts and answers out loud. It ends by itself 8 seconds after an answer if nobody speaks, and when Poki goes to the background (once a running step is done). Slide up to end it sooner. The microphone in the message field only dictates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在语音页按住按钮，就能开始实时对话：Poki 会听、会操作，并大声回答。回答后 8 秒内没人说话，或 Poki 进入后台（正在执行的步骤完成后），对话会自动结束。上滑可以提前结束。消息栏里的麦克风只用于听写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this iPhone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在此 iPhone 上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On-Device" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本机听写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One file with every routine and note. Importing merges it in; the newer copy of a routine wins. Poki Setup on your computer can back it up and put it back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个文件包含所有惯例和备注。导入时会合并，同一惯例以较新的为准。电脑上的 Poki Setup 可以备份和恢复它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Online" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only one account runs the text chat at a time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一时间只有一个账号用于文字对话。"
          }
