    "Poki can’t tap Send yet: UI Automation is off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 暂无法点发送：界面自动化未开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki closed after you stopped it. Open it to turn it on again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你停止 Poki 后它已关闭。打开它即可重新开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki closes by itself so agents can see the screen again. Open Poki again afterwards, from the notification or the Home Screen; it turns on when it opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 会自动关闭，让智能体重新看到屏幕。之后从通知或主屏幕重新打开 Poki，它打开时就会开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki could not reach %@: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法连接 %@：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki couldn’t read its relay key from the keychain (%@)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 无法从钥匙串读取中转密钥（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki downloads and signs updates from this channel ahead of time, the same way Poki Setup does. Stable gets full releases only; Beta, Alpha and Pre-alpha get earlier builds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 会提前从这个渠道下载并签名更新，和 Poki Setup 的做法一样。稳定版只获取正式版本；Beta、Alpha 和 Pre-alpha 会更早获得构建版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki downloads it again by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 会自动重新下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki gets the next build ready by itself, %lld days before it expires or when your channel has an update. It installs only when you tap Install." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 会在签名到期前 %lld 天，或你的渠道有更新时，自动准备好下一个版本。只有你轻点“安装”时才会安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki has no default relay. Deploy your own to your Cloudflare account with deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh from the Poki repository, then enter the address it prints. Screenshots and taps pass only through that relay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 没有默认中转。请用 Poki 仓库中的 deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh 把中转部署到你自己的 Cloudflare 账户，再输入它输出的地址。截图和轻点只经过这个中转。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki is offline. Check that the phone has internet; Poki reconnects by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 已离线。请检查此 iPhone 的网络连接，Poki 会自动重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki is on" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 已开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki is open, so it asks here instead" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 已打开，所以改在这里询问"
          }
