    },
    "Poki looks on GitHub for the newest build on the chosen channel." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 会在 GitHub 上查找所选通道的最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs a model account before it can reply." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加模型账号后 Poki 才能回复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs attention" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 需要你处理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs every item ticked before an agent or the chat can use this iPhone. Items tick themselves when the phone can check them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有项目都打勾后，智能体或对话才能使用此 iPhone。手机能检查的项目会自动打勾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs it once after each restart, then tries again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次重启后需要一次，然后会重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs the internet once after each restart of the phone to get Apple's signature for the developer disk image. Check Wi-Fi or cellular; Poki tries again by itself." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手机每次重启后，Poki 需要联网一次，为开发者磁盘映像获取 Apple 的签名。请检查无线局域网或蜂窝网络，Poki 会自动重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs the microphone and speech recognition: allow them in Settings › Poki." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 需要麦克风和语音识别权限，请在“设置”›“Poki”中允许。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs your OK" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 需要你批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki opens the main Settings page. Go to **Privacy & Security › Developer Mode** and tap **Pair with Poki**." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 将打开“设置”首页。前往“**隐私与安全 › 开发者模式**”并轻点“**Pair with Poki（与 Poki 配对）**”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki restarted so agents can see the screen again. It turns on when it opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 已重启，让智能体重新看到屏幕。它打开时就会开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki sends touches and keys over a screen-sharing session, and iOS turns the camera off in every app while one is open, so Poki opens it only for an action and closes it 5 seconds after the last one. With this on, Poki opens no session at all. If taps and typing still work, the camera is never affected; if they stop working, turn it off. Takes effect the next time Poki turns on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 通过屏幕共享会话发送触摸和按键，会话打开时 iOS 会关闭所有 App 的相机，所以 Poki 只在操作时打开会话，最后一次操作 5 秒后关闭。开启此项后，Poki 完全不打开会话。如果轻点和输入仍然有效，相机就不会受影响；如果失效，请关闭此项。在 Poki 下次开启时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki shows steps, pairing codes and approvals on the Lock Screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 会在锁定屏幕上显示步骤、配对码和批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki shows steps, pairing codes, and approvals on the Lock Screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 会在锁定屏幕上显示操作步骤、配对码和批准请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki signs in again when its signing is due, and asks you for the password then." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "签名到期时 Poki 会重新登录，并在那时请你输入密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki starts it again on the next agent request." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体下次发出请求时，Poki 会重新启动它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki stays active in the background without the location indicator, and never records your location." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 在后台保持运行，不显示定位标志，也从不记录你的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki stops opening after %@. Connect this iPhone to your Mac and ask your agent to renew it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 之后 Poki 将无法打开。请把这台 iPhone 连上 Mac，让 agent 为它续签。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki types through its own keyboard and never touches the clipboard. When the keyboard can’t be used, plain text is typed with key presses, and other text is not entered." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 通过自己的键盘输入，绝不使用剪贴板。键盘无法使用时，普通文字用按键输入，其他文字不会输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki types through its own keyboard panel, at a person’s pace. The panel has no keys: it shows while Poki types, and Take Over stops it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 通过自己的键盘面板以常人的速度输入。面板没有按键：Poki 输入时显示，轻点“接管”即可停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki types with key presses and pastes what the keys can’t type, such as Chinese and emoji. Your clipboard is put back afterwards. The Poki keyboard is not used." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 用按键输入，按键无法输入的内容（如中文和表情符号）通过粘贴输入，之后会恢复你的剪贴板。不使用 Poki 键盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki uses your ChatGPT Plus or Pro plan through OpenAI’s Sign in with ChatGPT. The sign-in stays in this iPhone’s Keychain. An OpenAI API key works too, as a backup: add it under OpenAI." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 通过 OpenAI 的“使用 ChatGPT 登录”使用你的 ChatGPT Plus 或 Pro 套餐，登录信息保存在此 iPhone 的钥匙串中。也可以用 OpenAI API 密钥作为备用，在 OpenAI 下添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki uses your ChatGPT plan, the way Codex does. The sign-in stays in this iPhone’s Keychain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 与 Codex 一样，共享你的 ChatGPT 订阅额度。登录信息仅保存在此 iPhone 的钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki will close by itself. Open it again once the update is in." : {
