          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is not a voice bridge address. It looks like http://192.168.1.10:47830/voice/ followed by a long code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音桥接地址格式有误。正确格式示例：http://192.168.1.10:47830/voice/ 后接一串字符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Live Activity did not start: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实时活动未能启动：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent acted %lld s ago; Install opens a minute after its last step." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体 %lld 秒前刚操作过；最后一步一分钟后才能安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent can't act on this screen. It waits for you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体无法在这个画面上操作，它在等你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent does not pay for you. It waits, then carries on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体不会替你付款，它会等待，然后继续。"
          }
