            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本机连接仍在停止中，请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local interface is present, but this iPhone does not answer at 10.7.0.1. Reconnect the local connection and check Wi-Fi. If it still does not answer, pair again in Setup › Pairing, then check Developer Mode." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本机接口已存在，但此 iPhone 在 10.7.0.1 没有应答。请重新连接本机连接并检查无线局域网；仍没有应答时，到“设置引导 › 配对”重新配对，然后再检查开发者模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model Poki’s chat and voice use on this iPhone. Memory holds the routines and notes every agent shares." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
