    },
    "The relay forwards agents’ requests to this iPhone while Poki is open or in the background. It stores nothing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 打开或在后台运行时，中继会把智能体的请求转发到此 iPhone，它不存储任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The relay forwards requests to this iPhone while Poki is open or in the background. It stores nothing; when offline, clients receive an error." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当 Poki 打开或在后台运行时，中转服务器会将请求转发至此 iPhone。服务器不存储任何数据；设备离线时，客户端会收到明确的错误提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The run log lists each routine run, where it stopped and how long it took, with no typed text. It helps the Poki maintainers make routines more reliable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "运行日志列出每次惯例运行、停在哪里和用了多久，不包含输入的文字，可以帮助 Poki 维护者让惯例更可靠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The runner starts when an agent asks." : {
