            "value" : "这会在恢复设备、重置“定位与隐私”或手机忘记 Poki 后发生。请用电脑上的 Poki Setup 重新配对，并把新文件发送到这里，旧密钥会被替换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This happens after a restore, a reset of Location & Privacy, or when the phone forgot Poki. Pair again; the old key is replaced." : {
